    "Delete…" : {
      "comment" : "A button of the Cards window that deletes the selected cards for good, asking first.\nA button of the Cards window, beside All Tags, that deletes the selected tags, asking first.\nAn item of a card type's menu in the Cards window's sidebar: it asks whether to delete the type.\nAn item of a deck's menu in the Cards window, on its row in the sidebar or in the Actions menu above the card list: it asks whether to delete the deck, with the decks inside it and their cards.\nAn item of a tag's menu in the Cards window's sidebar or its All Tags: it asks whether to delete the tag, or the tags selected with it.\nSettings, under Backups: moves the selected copies to the Trash, asking first.",
