    "Forgotten %lld times back first" : {
      "comment" : "The note the review panel offers to flag a card with, once the user answered “Again” to it this many times back first, its back shown on top, while it was graduated, out of its learning and relearning steps, since its front or back last changed: Anki's lapses. They can add to it.",
