    "Line %lld has the type “%@”, which isn't one of yours, and only a file that names its Type column in a #columns header makes new types." : {
      "comment" : "In the Import sheet, a line the file can't read, with the type it has, which names no card type the user has, in a file without a #columns header that names its Type column.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zeile %1$lld hat den Typ „%2$@“, der keiner deiner Typen ist, und nur eine Datei, die ihre Spalte Type in einer #columns-Kopfzeile benennt, erstellt neue Typen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Line %1$lld has the type “%2$@”, which isn't one of yours, and only a file that names its Type column in a #columns header makes new types."
